7:08:29-08:00","id":1473052,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1473018-heart-devouring-ritual?p=1473020#post1473020\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's a lot of cool ideas in this, but I'm struggling to figure out what the intentions are for these characters in play (and thus what's even the point of a lot of the mechanics). Are these meant to be another PC option next to standard Begotten? Are these for a group of normal mortal PCs to eventually power up with? Are these most NPC antagonists or at least complicated individuals the PCs need to decide what to do about?<br /> <br /> As it stands I'm not sure this can be all of those, but the material seems like it's trying to cover all the angles anyway.</div> </div> </div> </div>I guess I meant it to cover every possible angle at once. To be honest the idea came into my head the other day and so I sat down and started writing it and then the day was over and I figured I might as well post it in the form as it appears because there's not much point in further refinement yet. Thanks for the feedback.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Can they eat an Insatiable?</div> </div> </div> </div>I assume not like this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[]